# Faerie Mastermind: "Whenever an opponent draws their second card each turn, you draw a card." Bot2's draw step is
# their first draw of turn two; Brainstorm's three draws make the second, third and fourth, and only the second
# triggers it (CR 120.3), so Bot1 draws exactly one card.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Faerie Mastermind
Island x4
Island x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Brainstorm
Island x5
Island x16

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Faerie Mastermind.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Brainstorm.Cast
Bot2.Choose(Island; Island)

[Expect]
Turn = 2
Stack.Count = 0
Bot1.Battlefield = Island; Mox Sapphire; Faerie Mastermind
Bot1.Hand.Count = 5
Bot1.Library.Count = 15
Bot2.Graveyard = Brainstorm
Bot2.Hand.Count = 7
